# Profile Enhancements Walkthrough

I have enhanced the User Profile section with the following features:

## 1. Role Management
- Added `developer` (Founder/Development Admin) role to [UserRole](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/types/User.ts#15-16) type.
- Implemented a **Role Selector** in the "Edit Profile" modal (visible for testing) to switch roles without re-logging.

## 2. Profile Expansion
- **Full Screen Mode**: Tapping "EXPAND" on the Identity Card opens a detailed modal.
- **Identity Card Logic**: Added "Expand" button and updated flip logic.
- **Detailed View**: Shows extended contact info (School, Email, Phone) and a large QR code.

## 3. QR Code Integration
- **Unified Component**: Created [QRCodeGenerator](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/QRCodeGenerator.tsx#14-41) for consistent QR rendering.
- **Identity QR**: Back of Identity Card now displays user's unique ID as a QR code.
- **Invite QR**: Principals can now generate and view QR codes for inviting Teachers/Students in [InviteManager](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/principal/InviteManager.tsx#44-49).
- **Scan to Join**: Added a "Scan Identity QR" button to [AuthScreen](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/AuthScreen.tsx#60-551) (placeholder for scanner logic).

## 4. User Stats & Gamification
- Created [UserStatsCard](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/UserStatsCard.tsx#26-124) component.
- Dynamically displays stats based on role (e.g., "Classes Taught" for teachers, "Streak" for students).
- Added visual "Guru Level" progress bar placeholder.

## 5. Help & Support
- Added [SupportSection](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/SupportSection.tsx#13-70) with links to Contact Support, FAQs, and Report Issue.

## verification
- **Logout**: Verified `signOut` logic is attached to the Logout button.
- **UI Components**: Verified `gluestack-ui` components ([Modal](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/profile/EditProfileModal.tsx#41-267), `Button`, `HStack`, etc.) are correctly imported and used.
- **Dependencies**: Added `expo-image-picker` logic for photo editing. **Note:** You may need to run `npx expo install expo-image-picker` if the auto-install failed.

